<translate>
==== RunSpeedModifier ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Affects the player's running speed.

<!--T:3-->
('''NOTE:''' This option only works on backpacks and containers that are worn or carried)
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
RunSpeedModifier = 0.97,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

